e":"シュヴルーズ","textMapHash":577738066,"text":"それが千霊祭というものだろう。","nextNodeIds":[401360209]},{"nodeId":401360209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":4227170994,"text":"ああ。看護師長なんか栄養満点なスペシャルミルクセーキを用意してたぞ…ヘルシーさもまたスペシャルなやつをな。","nextNodeIds":[401360210]},{"nodeId":401360210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":15817082,"text":"仕事の話をしてたのか？","nextNodeIds":[401360211]},{"nodeId":401360211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1081,"speakerName":"シュヴルーズ","textMapHash":463193042,"text":"もう話は終わった。リオセスリさんへの「挨拶」も済ませた。…だろう？","nextNodeIds":[401360212]},{"nodeId":401360212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":4019029714,"text":"はっきりと返事をした覚えはないが。","nextNodeIds":[401360213]},{"nodeId":401360213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1081,"speakerName":"シュヴルーズ","textMapHash":22993306,"text":"でもノーとも言わなかった。","nextNodeIds":[401360214]},{"nodeId":401360214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1081,"speakerName":"シュヴルーズ","textMapHash":788531114,"text":"そうだ、いい考えがある。彼らに一人一部ずつ新聞を配ろう。たとえば、一面に二十年前の出来事が載ってる新聞とかな。","nextNodeIds":[401360215]},{"nodeId":401360215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":1959408298,"text":"そしたら一人、不運に見舞われるやつが出るだろうな。","nextNodeIds":[401360216]},{"nodeId":401360216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1081,"speakerName":"シュヴルーズ","textMapHash":2059166194,"text":"そして二人は、英雄扱いされることになる。","nextNodeIds":[401360217]},{"nodeId":401360217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":3935255754,"text":"英雄といえば、あんたら二人は俺に何か用か？","nextNodeIds":[401360218]},{"nodeId":401360218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1959068546,"text":"ええと、オイラたちが来たのは…","nextNodeIds":[401360219]},{"nodeId":401360219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1081,"speakerName":"シュヴルーズ","textMapHash":2620119666,"text":"私をパーティーに誘いに来たんだろう？今日が何の日か忘れてはいない。","nextNodeIds":[401360220]},{"nodeId":401360220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1382257490,"text":"へへっ、じゃあ急いで行こうぜ！","nextNodeIds":[401360221]},{"nodeId":401360221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3122878202,"text":"公爵、またな！よい千霊祭を！","nextNodeIds":[401360222]},{"nodeId":401360222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":4034686554,"text":"ああ、あんたらもな。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":4013611,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["4013601","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["4013602","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}